      "title": "Siemens Limited Announces Management Changes",
      "body": "Siemens Limited announced that Dr. Shilpa Kabra Maheshwari ceased to be the Head – People & Organisation of the Company, effective close of business hours of December 31, 2025. Ms. Sabine Schneider is appointed as the Head – People & Organisation of the Company, effective January 1, 2026. Mr. Rajiv Suri ceased to be the Head - Environmental Health and Safety of the Company, effective close of business hours of December 31, 2025. Ms. Sweta Praharaj is appointed as the Head - Environmental Health and Safety of the Company, effective January 1, 2026. Head - Strategy & Sustainability is categorised as Senior Management, effective January 1, 2026. The current Head of Strategy & Sustainability of the Company is Dr. Anantharaman Subramaniyan. Dr. Shilpa Kabra Maheshwari submitted her resignation ",
